{"seq":3,"slug":"er-modeling","title":"ER 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/er-modeling","wordCount":880,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"er-建模\">ER 建模</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实体-关系模型（Entity-Relationship Model，简称 ER 模型）是数据库概念设计的标准方法。它使用实体、属性和联系三个基本概念来描述现实世界的数据结构，是从需求分析到逻辑设计的桥梁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    STUDENT ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : &quot;选课&quot;&#10;    COURSE ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : &quot;被选&quot;&#10;    STUDENT {&#10;        string student_id PK&#10;        string name&#10;        date birth_date&#10;    }&#10;    COURSE {&#10;        string course_id PK&#10;        string title&#10;        int credits&#10;    }&#10;    ENROLLMENT {&#10;        string student_id FK&#10;        string course_id FK&#10;        int grade&#10;    }\">erDiagram\n    STUDENT ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : \"选课\"\n    COURSE ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : \"被选\"\n    STUDENT {\n        string student_id PK\n        string name\n        date birth_date\n    }\n    COURSE {\n        string course_id PK\n        string title\n        int credits\n    }\n    ENROLLMENT {\n        string student_id FK\n        string course_id FK\n        int grade\n    }</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本要素\">基本要素</h2><h3 id=\"实体与实体集\">实体与实体集</h3><p>实体是现实世界中可以区分的对象。同类实体的集合称为实体集。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强实体</td>\n<td>可独立存在，有自己的主键</td>\n<td>学生、课程、部门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱实体</td>\n<td>依赖于强实体才能存在</td>\n<td>家属（依赖于员工）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体集</td>\n<td>同类型实体的集合</td>\n<td>所有学生构成&quot;学生&quot;实体集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"属性类型\">属性类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单属性</td>\n<td>不可再分的原子值</td>\n<td>年龄、性别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合属性</td>\n<td>可拆分为更小的部分</td>\n<td>地址 → 省、市、区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多值属性</td>\n<td>一个实体可有多个值</td>\n<td>电话号码（可有多个）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生属性</td>\n<td>由其他属性计算得出</td>\n<td>年龄（由出生日期推导）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键属性</td>\n<td>唯一标识实体的属性</td>\n<td>学号、身份证号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"联系与联系集\">联系与联系集</h3><p>联系描述实体之间的语义关联。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    E1[实体1] --- R{联系} --- E2[实体2]\">graph LR\n    E1[实体1] --- R{联系} --- E2[实体2]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"联系的基数\">联系的基数</h2><p>基数（Cardinality）描述联系中实体参与的数量比例，是 ER 建模中最关键的决策之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基数类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一对一</td>\n<td>每个实体最多关联一个对方实体</td>\n<td>员工 ↔ 工位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一对多</td>\n<td>一个实体关联多个对方实体</td>\n<td>部门 → 员工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对多</td>\n<td>双方实体可关联多个对方实体</td>\n<td>学生 ↔ 课程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    EMPLOYEE ||--|| WORKSTATION : &quot;分配&quot;&#10;    DEPARTMENT ||--o{ EMPLOYEE : &quot;隶属&quot;&#10;    STUDENT }o--o{ COURSE : &quot;选修&quot;\">erDiagram\n    EMPLOYEE ||--|| WORKSTATION : \"分配\"\n    DEPARTMENT ||--o{ EMPLOYEE : \"隶属\"\n    STUDENT }o--o{ COURSE : \"选修\"</pre><h3 id=\"参与约束\">参与约束</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>ER 图表示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全参与</td>\n<td>实体集中每个实体都参与</td>\n<td>双线连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分参与</td>\n<td>仅部分实体参与联系</td>\n<td>单线连接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"er-图设计实践\">ER 图设计实践</h2><h3 id=\"电商系统-er-模型\">电商系统 ER 模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    USER ||--o{ ORDER : &quot;下单&quot;&#10;    ORDER ||--|{ ORDER_ITEM : &quot;包含&quot;&#10;    PRODUCT ||--o{ ORDER_ITEM : &quot;被购买&quot;&#10;    PRODUCT }o--|| CATEGORY : &quot;归属&quot;&#10;    USER {&#10;        bigint user_id PK&#10;        varchar username&#10;        varchar email&#10;        timestamp created_at&#10;    }&#10;    ORDER {&#10;        bigint order_id PK&#10;        bigint user_id FK&#10;        decimal total_amount&#10;        varchar status&#10;        timestamp order_date&#10;    }&#10;    PRODUCT {&#10;        bigint product_id PK&#10;        varchar name&#10;        decimal price&#10;        int stock&#10;    }&#10;    CATEGORY {&#10;        int category_id PK&#10;        varchar name&#10;    }&#10;    ORDER_ITEM {&#10;        bigint item_id PK&#10;        bigint order_id FK&#10;        bigint product_id FK&#10;        int quantity&#10;        decimal unit_price&#10;    }\">erDiagram\n    USER ||--o{ ORDER : \"下单\"\n    ORDER ||--|{ ORDER_ITEM : \"包含\"\n    PRODUCT ||--o{ ORDER_ITEM : \"被购买\"\n    PRODUCT }o--|| CATEGORY : \"归属\"\n    USER {\n        bigint user_id PK\n        varchar username\n        varchar email\n        timestamp created_at\n    }\n    ORDER {\n        bigint order_id PK\n        bigint user_id FK\n        decimal total_amount\n        varchar status\n        timestamp order_date\n    }\n    PRODUCT {\n        bigint product_id PK\n        varchar name\n        decimal price\n        int stock\n    }\n    CATEGORY {\n        int category_id PK\n        varchar name\n    }\n    ORDER_ITEM {\n        bigint item_id PK\n        bigint order_id FK\n        bigint product_id FK\n        int quantity\n        decimal unit_price\n    }</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"er-到关系模型转换\">ER 到关系模型转换</h2><p>ER 模型设计完成后，需要转换为关系数据库中的表结构。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ER 元素</th>\n<th>转换规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强实体</td>\n<td>直接映射为一张表，键属性作为主键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱实体</td>\n<td>映射为表，主键 = 自身部分键 + 所属强实体主键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一对一联系</td>\n<td>任一方添加外键，或合并为一张表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一对多联系</td>\n<td>&quot;多&quot;方添加外键指向&quot;一&quot;方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对多联系</td>\n<td>创建中间表（关联表），包含双方主键作为外键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多值属性</td>\n<td>创建独立的表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合属性</td>\n<td>展开为多个简单属性列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"转换示例\">转换示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 强实体 → 表&#10;CREATE TABLE department (&#10;    dept_id   INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    dept_name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 一对多联系 → 外键&#10;CREATE TABLE employee (&#10;    emp_id    INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name      VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,&#10;    dept_id   INT,&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES department(dept_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 弱实体 → 复合主键&#10;CREATE TABLE dependent (&#10;    emp_id         INT,&#10;    dependent_name VARCHAR(50),&#10;    relationship   VARCHAR(20),&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (emp_id, dependent_name),&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (emp_id) REFERENCES employee(emp_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 多对多联系 → 中间表&#10;CREATE TABLE student_course (&#10;    student_id VARCHAR(10),&#10;    course_id  VARCHAR(10),&#10;    grade      INT,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (student_id, course_id),&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (student_id) REFERENCES student(student_id),&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (course_id) REFERENCES course(course_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 强实体 → 表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 一对多联系 → 外键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dept_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department(dept_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 弱实体 → 复合主键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dependent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dependent_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relationship   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (emp_id, dependent_name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (emp_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee(emp_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 多对多联系 → 中间表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> student_course</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    course_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    grade      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (student_id, course_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (student_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student(student_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (course_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> course(course_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"建模常见陷阱\">建模常见陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扇形陷阱</td>\n<td>从一个实体通过两个一对多联系</td>\n<td>调整联系路径或增加直接联系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>裂缝陷阱</td>\n<td>联系路径不完整导致信息丢失</td>\n<td>添加缺失的联系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度设计</td>\n<td>将简单属性建模为独立实体</td>\n<td>遵循 KISS 原则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余联系</td>\n<td>可通过现有联系推导的重复联系</td>\n<td>删除冗余联系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((ER 建模))&#10;    基本要素&#10;      实体 强/弱&#10;      属性 简单/复合/多值/派生&#10;      联系 一对一/一对多/多对多&#10;    设计过程&#10;      需求分析&#10;      识别实体和属性&#10;      确定联系和基数&#10;      ER 图绘制&#10;    转换规则&#10;      强实体 → 表&#10;      一对多 → 外键&#10;      多对多 → 中间表&#10;      弱实体 → 复合主键&#10;    注意事项&#10;      避免扇形/裂缝陷阱&#10;      适度抽象\">mindmap\n  root((ER 建模))\n    基本要素\n      实体 强/弱\n      属性 简单/复合/多值/派生\n      联系 一对一/一对多/多对多\n    设计过程\n      需求分析\n      识别实体和属性\n      确定联系和基数\n      ER 图绘制\n    转换规则\n      强实体 → 表\n      一对多 → 外键\n      多对多 → 中间表\n      弱实体 → 复合主键\n    注意事项\n      避免扇形/裂缝陷阱\n      适度抽象</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>ER 模型</strong>使用实体、属性、联系三要素描述数据结构，是概念设计的核心工具。</li>\n<li><strong>基数约束</strong>（一对一、一对多、多对多）决定了表之间的关联方式。</li>\n<li>ER 到关系模型的<strong>转换规则</strong>明确，多对多联系必须通过中间表实现。</li>\n<li>弱实体的主键由自身部分键和所属强实体的主键共同组成。</li>\n<li>设计时需警惕<strong>扇形陷阱</strong>和<strong>裂缝陷阱</strong>，确保联系路径的完整性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ER 建模","id":"er-建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本要素","id":"基本要素"},{"level":3,"text":"实体与实体集","id":"实体与实体集"},{"level":3,"text":"属性类型","id":"属性类型"},{"level":3,"text":"联系与联系集","id":"联系与联系集"},{"level":2,"text":"联系的基数","id":"联系的基数"},{"level":3,"text":"参与约束","id":"参与约束"},{"level":2,"text":"ER 图设计实践","id":"er-图设计实践"},{"level":3,"text":"电商系统 ER 模型","id":"电商系统-er-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"ER 到关系模型转换","id":"er-到关系模型转换"},{"level":3,"text":"转换示例","id":"转换示例"},{"level":2,"text":"建模常见陷阱","id":"建模常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范式与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/normalization"},"next":{"title":"数据完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/data-integrity"}}